      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "The labeled add-person action.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M6 12H12M18 12H12M12 12V6M12 12V18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n</svg>Person hinzufügen</button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font-family:\"Nunito Sans\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:52px;padding:12px 21px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:10px;background:var(--teal-dark,#116b5b);color:white;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;transition:background-color 160ms cubic-bezier(.2,.85,.25,1),transform 130ms cubic-bezier(.2,.85,.25,1)}.ds-primary svg{width:22px;height:22px}.ds-primary:hover{background:#0d584b}.ds-primary:active{transform:scale(.97)}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--teal,#19937e);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Icon action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-icon",
      "description": "Obvious actions retain an accessible name and tooltip.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-icon\" aria-label=\"Erinnerung speichern\" title=\"Erinnerung speichern\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M5 13L9 17L19 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n</svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-icon{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:44px;height:44px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:13px;color:var(--teal-dark,#116b5b);background:transparent;transition:background-color 150ms cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1),transform 130ms cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1)}.ds-icon svg{width:22px;height:22px}.ds-icon:hover{background:#e8f1ec}.ds-icon:active{transform:scale(.97)}.ds-icon:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--teal,#19937e);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Profile field",
